Auto-Generation from Code
With tools like swagger-jsdoc
, you can keep docs next to your code:
/**
* @openapi
* /users/{id}:
* get:
* summary: Get a user by ID
* parameters:
* - in: path
* name: id
* required: true
* schema:
* type: integer
* responses:
* 200:
